#import "../template.typ": somatic_page

// PHASE 6 - PAGE 32: DARK EMOTIONS - PROMPTS
// Mirroring technique + Mad-lib structured prompts per Shadow Work Philosopher

#somatic_page(
  title: "The Forbidden Feelings",
  body_text: [
    Notice what happens in your body as you prepare to name the unspeakable. Perhaps your jaw tightens, your belly clenches, or a wave of heat rises in your face. This is the body bracing against exposure. Breathe. *These feelings cannot hurt you when witnessed.*
    
    #v(0.5cm)
    
    #set text(style: "italic", size: 10.5pt)
    
    *1. The emotion I am most ashamed of feeling is* __________ *(jealousy, rage, hatred, desire for revenge, contempt, lust)*.
    
    When I feel this emotion, my body responds with __________.
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))

    #v(0.8cm)
    *2. I learned this emotion was unacceptable from* __________.
    
    The message I received was: "__________."
    
    What happened when I expressed this emotion was __________.
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))

    #v(0.8cm)
    *3. If I could rage, scream, or weep freely right now with no consequences, I would* __________.
    
    The thing I have never allowed myself to say is: "__________."
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
  ],
  image_path: none,
  layout_style: "bottom"
)
